Description:
First-party Atrium code, not a third-party import. It sits under third_party
because GN cannot reach outside the Chromium checkout, and the crate has to be
inside the tree for GN to build it. The copy you edit lives in the Atrium repo
at rust/atrium-core; `make rust-verify` fails when the two drift apart.

Local Modifications:
None.
